# T4.8a: two rooms, the east one's ceiling at 55 (RouteTestMaps): the
# 56-unit player does not fit (refused, sliding along the boundary): run
# east into it, slide along it, turn north-east, run strafing left, walk
# diagonally into it, back off.
iwad testmap
map ceiling55
# forwardmove sidemove turn buttons [xcount]; turn << 8 = angleturn
50 0 0 0 x30
0 0 0 0 x8
50 30 0 0 x30
0 0 4 0 x8
50 -20 0 0 x30
25 25 0 0 x20
-50 0 0 0 x20
